    "magnitude": "C - D >= 0.0036, v1.7's minimum detectable difference - a decision point where real care adapts turns the closed-loop share from undetectable into detectable.",
    "horizon_artefact": "MCTS declines salvage more often for recurrences in year 4 than earlier. Expected to hold; if it does, part of prediction 3 is an artefact of where the game ends.",
    "why": "v1.7 found no closed-loop share and blamed an environment that offers one chance to adapt in 20.8% of episodes. v1.6 showed real care adapts at progression. v0.6 opens a decision at recurrence to test whether the share appears once there is somewhere to adapt."
